<title>DUBAI: Sharjah airport cargo volumes rise 34 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Sharjah airport cargo volumes rise 34 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose 34 percent in April to 34,360 tonnes from 25,590 tonnes in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose a year-on-year 10 percent to 2,454 tonnes.</p>
<p>April's overall cargo figure was lower than the 36,174 tonnes handled in March this year. -- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
</text>
